# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# NOTE: We used to have `/wish  /wish.html  200` here as a fallback for when
# Cloudflare Pages Functions were disabled. But Pages does its own canonical
# redirect from /wish.html → /wish whenever a Function exists at /wish, and
# together with the rewrite this created an infinite 308 loop that surfaced
# as Cloudflare error 1019 to the user. functions/wish.js now handles /wish
# on its own (with a safe static-asset fallback for any error), so no
# rewrite rule is needed. Leaving this file present-but-empty so CF Pages
# doesn't complain.
